// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in a real key.
//
// The project is already wired for it, so copying and filling in is all that is
// needed. For reference, the wiring is:
//   - Secrets.xcconfig is the base configuration file for the project's Debug
//     and Release configurations.
//   - Agentic-Info.plist (tracked, holds no secret) maps TavilyAPIKey to
//     $(TAVILY_API_KEY), and the Agentic target sets INFOPLIST_FILE to it.
//     GENERATE_INFOPLIST_FILE stays on, so the INFOPLIST_KEY_ settings still
//     merge in on top.
//   - loadTavilyKey() reads it via Bundle.main.object(forInfoDictionaryKey:).
//
// INFOPLIST_KEY_TavilyAPIKey does not work for this. That mechanism only honours
// Info.plist keys Xcode knows about and silently drops anything else, which is
// why the partial Info.plist exists.
//
// Without a Secrets.xcconfig, WebSearchTool falls back to the TAVILY_API_KEY
// environment variable, and web search is simply unavailable if neither is set.

TAVILY_API_KEY = your-tavily-api-key-here
